From c5d17dd031e2c4b968ade7047e4839f64ab14625 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:29:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] DeferredReportBatchExecutionPolicy: name of the policy whose
 report is deferred

`AsynchronousBatchExecutionPolicy` is renamed
`DeferredReportBatchExecutionPolicy` (and `checkAsynchronousBatchExecutionPolicy`
`checkDeferredReportBatchExecutionPolicy`): since the execution policies of
the backends, the computations are asynchronous if the policy of the backend
requests it, and this policy only defers the report: the status of the
computations is held by the returned object, which gives the result once the
queue is synchronized. The name is the one used by TFEL for this case
(deferred report).
